NAME
    gcloud alpha service-health artifacts - represents a report for a Google
        Cloud outage

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha service-health artifacts COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Represents a report for a Google Cloud outage.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Get details of an artifact for a project.

     list
        (ALPHA) List artifacts for a project.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

